        {
            "+content": "Masaru Kazuno has had enough. Sick of the rat race, sick of competing, and sick of other people sizing him up, he's decided that the best way to avoid being ranked and ridiculed by his classmates is to stay safe and sound at home. But when Kazuno's house—and all of his classmates—are suddenly transported to a world of high fantasy, his quiet life is turned upside down. Determined to save those closest to him, Kazuno ventures forth and faces life in the wild... with all the comforts and conveniences of modern living, right at home. Turns out his house might just be the gift that keeps on giving.",
